# Forms

Use React Hook Form + Zod when available in the repository.

## Rules

- Validate client-side for fast feedback.
- Treat server validation as authoritative.
- Keep error messages human-readable.
- Preserve user input after recoverable server errors.
- Disable duplicate submissions while a request is in progress.
- Handle keyboard overlap correctly.
- Use appropriate keyboard types.
- Support autofill where appropriate.

## Onboarding

Language onboarding should make it easy to select:
- native/spoken languages
- target/learning languages
- proficiency
- learning goals
- interests

Avoid asking for unnecessary information before the user reaches value.

## OTP/auth

- Handle paste/autofill when supported.
- Provide clear resend states.
- Never log OTPs.
- Never store OTPs in app state longer than necessary.
